Hi {Owner},

I build websites for mobile mechanics around {City}. {Business Name} has good on-site repair work on social, but nothing a stranger can find that shows what you fix in a driveway or lets them book.

Rather than ask for your time, I built a sample first: a list of repairs you do on site, a request form that collects the address and vehicle, a no-start and dead-battery page, and a pre-purchase inspection page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
